<title>UK: Credit Lyonnais sets call warrants on Nikkei 225.</title>
<headline>Credit Lyonnais sets call warrants on Nikkei 225.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Product (Guernsey) has issued French franc and dollar denominated American-style call warrants of one million per tranche on the Nikkei 225 index, lead manager Credit Lyonnais said.</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 11.FEB.97-27.JAN.99   PAYDATE	10.FEB.97</p>
<p> MIN EXER LOT    1,000</p>
<p>* * * *</p>
<p> WARRANT		 STRIKE PRICE	 ISSUE PRICE</p>
<p>US$ DENOMINATED WARRANTS</p>
<p> CALL A		  16,500		 $21.57</p>
<p> CALL B		  17,500		 $17.25</p>
<p> CALL C		  19,500		 $10.27</p>
<p>FFR DENOMINATED WARRANTS</p>
<p> CALL A		  16,500		 117.82 FFR</p>
<p> CALL B		  17,500		  93.63 FFR</p>
<p> CALL C		  19,500		  55.76 FFR</p>
<p> NOTES</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
